Jason: But the excitement Maggie.He had such enthusiasm.

151
00:09:26,620 --> 00:09:29,940
他有如此的热情.我之前从来没有见过他这样子.他眼睛里有真实的光芒.
I've never seen that look in him before.He had a real spark in his eye.

152
00:09:29,940 --> 00:09:32,440
