我在大学里也录制了一两张唱片.
I cut a demo or two in college you know.

170
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:33,180
本:爸爸,我们在这里讨论音乐,
Ben: Dad, we are talking about music here,

171
00:10:33,180 --> 00:10:34,980
而不是一群老家伙上窜下跳.
not a bunch of old guys jumping up and down.

172
