202
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:55,880
杰森:对不起.只是我今天对税方面比较古怪.
Jason: I'm sorry.I just get a little bit weird on tax day.

203
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:58,040
那五千块钱是非常有用的.
The five thousand is going to come in very handy.

204
00:11:58,120 --> 00:12:00,920
麦琪:哦,不,我花了.我这里只有支票存根.
Maggie: Oh no, I spent that.I just have these check stubs here.

205
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:04,920
杰森:只是存根!
Jason: Just the stubs!

206
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:07,060
麦琪:是的,亲爱的.
Maggie: Yeah honey.And they didn't take out much with-holding.

207
00:12:07,060 --> 00:12:09,220
他们没有扣很多税.我得到百分之九十九.
I took out ninety nine deductions.

208
