Maggie: I've got to hand it to you sweetheart,

217
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:44,260
以前星期六前他从来不做家庭作业.
he's never done his homework on Saturday before.

218
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:46,240
杰森:是的,他甚至修了草坪.当然,
Jason: Yes, he even mowed the lawn.

219
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:49,000
因为下雪,看不见草,但是他的想法是好的.
Sure, you couldn't see the grass for the snow, but the thought was right.

220
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,280
麦琪:当在吃饭的时候他掉了一块猪排,他用自己的衬衫擦干净,
Maggie: And at dinner when he dropped that pork chop,

