Maggie: Jason, you are kidding yourself.You are manipulating him with your checkbook.

227
00:13:09,940 --> 00:13:12,760
杰森:麦琪:行了.我没有操控任何人.
Jason: Maggie, come on.I do not manipulate anybody.

228
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:13,400
