杰森:停止,合作伙伴.合作关系跟这个没有关系,本.在这间房间里面,我们是父亲和儿子.
Jason: Hold it there partner.The partner ship has nothing to do with this moment Ben.In this room we are father and son.

248
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:21,980
本:那么我们去客厅吧.
Ben: Well then let's go out in the hall.

249
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:25,980
杰森:你溜进来干什么的?
Jason: What are you doing sneaking in?

250
00:14:26,380 --> 00:14:28,200
本:我怎么进来?我溜出去.
Ben: How else could I get in?I snuck out.

251
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:32,660
本:我对你很失望,
Jason: I am so disappointed in you Ben.

252
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:35,760
本.
After I invested two thousand dollars in you.

253
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,600
在我向你投资了两千块之后.你会怎么想这对于我的感受?
